      "effect": "You can Ritual Summon this card with a \"Marincess\" card. Monsters your opponent controls lose 1000 ATK. You can only use each of the following effects of \"Aqua Leviathan @Marincess\" once per turn. You can reveal this card in your hand; add 1 \"Marincess\" card from your Deck to your hand, except a Ritual Monster, then discard 1 card. If this card is Ritual Summoned: You can return cards your opponent controls to the hand up to the number of \"Marincess\" Monster Cards you control.",
